      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MORE RAIN (4) lines up here off a comfortable win at this track after jumping from box 8 (19.43). Has the squeeze box to overcome and will need the breaks early. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Ideally placed to take this out. BARDWELL (5) has been in the placings at his last two runs, most recently when second (19.37) in a Mix 5 over 350m at Q Straight. Well placed here and should do much better. OUTLAW NANCY (1) was prominent throughout off a low draw but dropped right out when 6th over 366m at this track in a Mix 5. Can measure up this time. SOLO RUPEE (2) was a last-start winner at big odds and is in the mix again.",
